1
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:09,480
(Thanks, Ms. Song Huan.)

2
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:10,759
(You're looking lovely as ever.)

3
00:00:10,759 --> 00:00:11,839
Hi, Ms. Song Huan.

4
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:13,240
Long time no see, Ms. Song Huan.

5
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:13,839
Long time no see.

6
00:00:13,839 --> 00:00:15,519
About the project we discussed by phone,

7
00:00:15,519 --> 00:00:16,320
let's talk over here.

8
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,000
It's quieter.

9
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:17,600
Okay?

10
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:18,359
Sure.

11
00:00:18,359 --> 00:00:19,359
This way.

12
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:23,519
You don't need to come with me.

13
00:00:23,719 --> 00:00:24,600
Wait here.

14
00:00:26,839 --> 00:00:27,320
Hello.

15
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:28,960
I'm Yu Song, Ms. Song Huan's
executive assistant.

16
00:00:29,039 --> 00:00:29,760
Nice to meet you.

17
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:30,239
Me too.

18
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:31,920
Here's my card.

19
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:41,640
Yu Song.

20
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:45,320
It really is you.

21
00:00:45,719 --> 00:00:48,600
Well, if it isn't my cousin
who reeks of fish.

22
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,000
Kexin...

23
00:00:53,359 --> 00:00:54,439
Long time no see.

24
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,200
How's your family?

25
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,119
How dare you ask!

26
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:00,560
Because you refused to marry
that old man with a limp,

27
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,399
you cost my parents 20,000 yuan.

28
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:05,200
Now that I've run into you,

29
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,239
pay us back.

30
00:01:14,519 --> 00:01:16,719
You want money? Then marry him yourself.

31
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:19,920
That old man with a limp
is pretty rich, after all.

32
00:01:20,319 --> 00:01:21,319
He's perfect for you.

33
00:01:21,599 --> 00:01:22,400
You...

34
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,319
This is a private dinner.

35
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:29,680
How did a broke nobody like you

36
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:30,959
get in here?

37
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:33,959
This gown

38
00:01:33,959 --> 00:01:36,000
is a convincing designer knockoff.

39
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:37,799
Don't tell me...

40
00:01:39,079 --> 00:01:40,879
you found yourself a sugar daddy?

41
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:58,719
Here.

42
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:04,680
You...

43
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:07,760
Mr. Li...

44
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:08,719
Look at her...

45
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:10,520
Just apologize and we'll drop it.

46
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,520
An apology isn't enough.

47
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:20,639
Kneel!

48
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,159
Wipe my shoes clean.

49
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,319
Ms. Song Huan.

50
00:03:11,919 --> 00:03:12,639
Mr. Li.

51
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,719
Since when is it your place

52
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,719
to lecture my assistant?

53
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:17,840
Ms. Song Huan.

54
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:19,000
It's a misunderstanding.

55
00:03:19,039 --> 00:03:20,159
My staff was out of line.

56
00:03:20,639 --> 00:03:21,400
Xu Kexin!

57
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,800
Apologize to Ms. Yu now.

58
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,560
Or you're fired on the spot!

59
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:25,800
Ms. Song Huan.

60
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:26,719
I'm so sorry.

61
00:03:28,319 --> 00:03:29,319
She's my younger cousin.

62
00:03:29,319 --> 00:03:30,319
It's all a misunderstanding.

63
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:33,879
Yu Song.

64
00:03:34,479 --> 00:03:35,439
How do you want to handle this?

65
00:03:43,639 --> 00:03:44,639
Xu...

66
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:45,560
Ms. Xu...

67
00:03:46,159 --> 00:03:47,439
Your shoes got dirty.

68
00:03:47,439 --> 00:03:48,960
You weren't watching your step.

69
00:03:49,199 --> 00:03:51,319
But you got
my executive assistant's shoes dirty.

70
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,520
Do I need to teach you what to do?

71
00:03:59,639 --> 00:04:00,120
Mr. Li.

72
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:03,840
Your employee doesn't seem to listen.

73
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,960
Xu Kexin, what are you waiting for?

74
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:06,919
Go wipe her shoes clean. Now!

75
00:04:27,399 --> 00:04:29,839
(Actually, I never meant to
give anyone a hard time.)

76
00:04:30,399 --> 00:04:33,079
(I just wanted to tell those
who feel superior...)

77
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:35,839
(It's not just a glass I'm breaking.)

78
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:39,959
(It's the condescension
they were born with.)

79
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:45,839
Ms. Yu.

80
00:04:45,839 --> 00:04:46,759
Nice to meet you.

81
00:04:51,279 --> 00:04:52,199
(Nigang,)

82
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:55,439
(seen by many as a hunting ground
for fame and fortune.)

83
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,560
(People all believe)

84
00:04:57,560 --> 00:05:00,160
(who you follow sets your price.)

85
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:02,160
(But relying on the powerful)

86
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:04,439
(and giving up the pursuit
of your own self-worth)

87
00:05:04,759 --> 00:05:06,199
(is what's truly worthless.)

88
00:05:20,639 --> 00:05:24,759
(Your worth shouldn't be defined
by others.)

89
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:26,639
(Real worth)

90
00:05:26,639 --> 00:05:29,000
(lies in staying true to yourself)

91
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,759
(no matter the circumstances)

92
00:05:30,959 --> 00:05:32,720
(and carrying yourself with grace)

93
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:34,680
(Don't cling to the powerful.)

94
00:05:34,759 --> 00:05:36,519
(Song Group)
(Nor act arrogant or rash.)

95
00:05:43,519 --> 00:05:44,199
(Ms. Yu.)

96
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,160
(Hello, Ms. Yu.)

97
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,279
(Ms. Yu.)

98
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:50,720
Some are pinned in the shadows
of their past, left to rot.

99
00:05:51,959 --> 00:05:53,439
But we stand in the light,

100
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:57,480
so only our shadows fall
at other people's feet.

101
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,879
Yu Song.

102
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,600
This is the view

103
00:06:08,519 --> 00:06:10,199
you can only see by following me.

104
00:06:10,879 --> 00:06:12,000
(Light and shadow...)

105
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:13,879
(Neither is superior or inferior.)

106
00:06:14,959 --> 00:06:16,800
(Those who trample on others' pasts)

107
00:06:17,519 --> 00:06:19,040
(may be riding high for now,)

108
00:06:19,519 --> 00:06:21,120
(but they still hide in the shadows.)

109
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:23,920
(They'll fall into darkness)

110
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:25,279
=Dear Song=
(and lose all that's good.)

111
00:06:25,300 --> 00:06:27,786
=Episode 15=
(The Unspoken Secret)

112
00:06:27,866 --> 00:06:31,320
(Song Group)

113
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:41,560
Chairman Wang, real estate.

114
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,680
Mr. Li, tech.

115
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:44,319
Li Weian of Haitong.

116
00:06:45,319 --> 00:06:46,920
And Zhou Xinliang.

117
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,199
Look into them.

118
00:06:48,199 --> 00:06:50,800
Find out what business ties they have
with each other and Song Huan.

119
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:51,959
I want to use this lead

120
00:06:51,959 --> 00:06:54,519
to figure out
how Song Group really runs.

121
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,600
Sure.

122
00:06:56,319 --> 00:06:56,879
Oh, right.

123
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:59,120
Song Huan's taking
some mysterious pills.

124
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,199
I don't know what it is.

125
00:07:00,199 --> 00:07:01,240
Look into that, too.

126
00:07:01,519 --> 00:07:02,319
Okay.

127
00:07:08,199 --> 00:07:09,000
What's wrong?

128
00:07:09,319 --> 00:07:10,560
The Song family says...

129
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:12,199
Song Cheng barely ate again today.

130
00:07:14,839 --> 00:07:16,720
Didn't they hire her a new assistant?

131
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,920
She's been holed up in her room.

132
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:20,560
The new assistant

133
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,720
can't do much either.

134
00:07:24,319 --> 00:07:25,079
Maybe...

135
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,560
You should go see her.

136
00:07:32,519 --> 00:07:33,319
No.

137
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:26,879
(The Song family's old estate?)

138
00:08:27,879 --> 00:08:30,519
(Jing says he didn't know Song Jing
well.)

139
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:57,399
Yu Song.

140
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,320
What are you doing here?

141
00:11:04,559 --> 00:11:05,600
I heard...

142
00:11:06,519 --> 00:11:08,840
Your assistant hasn't been taking
good care of you lately.

143
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:10,919
I guessed you'd come back here.

144
00:11:10,919 --> 00:11:12,080
So I came to check on you.

145
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:13,879
Yu Song.

146
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:17,399
Don't get too close to the secret
buried deep within the Song family.

147
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:34,360
(Jing says these are psychiatric meds.)

148
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:37,919
(Song Group, Song Huaishan)
(What terrifies her so much?)

149
00:11:38,399 --> 00:11:39,360
(Is it Song Huaishan,)

150
00:11:39,720 --> 00:11:40,679
(Song Cheng,)

151
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,879
(or another family secret?)

152
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:46,440
(The basement Song Cheng
warned me away from.)

153
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:49,120
(That secret buried deep
within the Song family...)

154
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:50,480
(What exactly is it?)

155
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:52,720
(And then there's...)

156
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:56,000
(the youngest son no one dares
to mention.)

157
00:11:57,279 --> 00:11:58,480
(Who is he?)
